              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Increased incidence in Saluki, French bulldog, Irish water spaniel, flat-coated retriever, golden retriever, boxer, Afghan hound, English Setter, Scottish terrier, Boston terrier, bulldog, German shepherd dog.",
